      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Inland Revenue Board of Malaysia (Amendment) Bill 2011"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Inland Revenue Board of Malaysia (Amendment) Act 2011."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 3 is deemed to come into operation on 1 November 2011. Amendment of section 6a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@/~cl_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@/~cl_2__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Inland Revenue Board of Malaysia Act 1995 [Act 533], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in section 6a—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1a) The Board shall, after consulting the chief executive officer, appoint two or more deputy chief executive officers.”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@/~cl_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (2), by inserting after the words “chief executive officer” the words “and the deputy chief executive officers”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@/~cl_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (3) the following subsection: “(3) In the event the chief executive officer is temporarily unable to perform his duties due to illness or any other cause, the Minister shall, on the recommendation of the Board, appoint one of the deputy chief executive officers to act in place of the chief executive officer during the period of inability.”. New section 10b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/31/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 10a the following section: “Additional function of the Board 10b. The Board may perform such other function as may be directed by the Minister, including the management of moneys and disbursement of the moneys to any person.”."
      }
    }
  ]
}
